<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Klipton seals deal to buy Armed Response.</title>
<headline>Klipton seals deal to buy Armed Response.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Klipton Ltd said on Thursday that it had sealed a deal to buy Armed Response Group (Pty) Ltd for 26 million rand.</p>
<p>The firm had been conducting a due diligence investigation into the business and the price tag has been cut from 29 million rand.</p>
<p>Klipton on May 9 first announced it intended to  acquire the security firm's operations.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
